  "Off, your own background is left out of it: the theme keeps its own colours while the picture is up, and only moves when a title's artwork covers it.": "Apabila mati, latar anda sendiri dibiarkan di luar: tema mengekalkan warnanya sendiri selagi gambar dipaparkan, dan hanya berubah apabila grafik sesebuah tajuk menutupinya.",
  "On the air": "Sedang disiarkan",
  "On, the background follows whichever card you're pointing at or have selected. Off, it only changes when you actually open something — steadier on a long list, where sweeping across a row otherwise repaints the whole window card by card.": "Apabila hidup, latar mengikut kad yang anda tuding atau pilih. Apabila mati, ia hanya berubah apabila anda benar-benar membuka sesuatu — lebih tenang pada senarai panjang, di mana meredah satu baris jika tidak akan melukis semula seluruh tetingkap kad demi kad.",
  "On, your picture is what the app rests on and the artwork covers it while you're on a film or show. Off, the picture stays put and nothing ever covers it.": "Apabila hidup, apl bersandar pada gambar anda, dan grafik menutupinya selagi anda berada pada sesebuah filem atau siri. Apabila mati, gambar kekal di tempatnya dan tiada apa pernah menutupinya.",
