  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Kemas kini tidak dapat dipasang: {error}",
  "Theme": "Tema",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Di sini hampir tiada ruang untuk satu filem pun. Pasangkan pemacu USB pada kotak — diformat sebagai FAT32, yang diterima setiap kotak Android — dan ia akan muncul di atas untuk dimuat turun ke situ.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Tiada akaun untuk log masuk dan tiada apa disegerakkan ke pelayan. Apa yang anda tonton, sejauh mana anda sampai, kegemaran anda dan senarai tontonan anda semuanya disimpan pada peranti ini dan tidak pernah meninggalkannya. Penyegerakan antara skrin sedang dirancang; sehingga itu, sandaran di bawah ialah cara pustaka berpindah.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Tiada {file} dalam folder dokumen anda. Salin satu ke sana dan cuba lagi.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Sambungan ini bermeter buat masa ini.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Sambungan ini tidak bermeter buat masa ini.",
  "This content is rated {rating} and exceeds your parental control settings.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This content is rated {rating} and exceeds your parental control settings.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Penyahkod peranti ini menyerah pada fail itu. Biasanya puncanya audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) dan DTS tidak dilesenkan ke dalam paparan web sistem, jadi keluaran yang membawanya dimainkan sebagai gambar tanpa bunyi, atau langsung tidak. Keluaran x264 dengan audio AAC akan dimainkan.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Fail ini mempunyai satu trek audio.",
  "This is separate from the performance switch below on purpose. That one turns off blur, which is expensive to draw; the movement here is built out of the two things a graphics chip does almost for free, so a television can usually keep it.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This is separate from the performance switch below on purpose. That one turns off blur, which is expensive to draw; the movement here is built out of the two things a graphics chip does almost for free, so a television can usually keep it.",
